— 🇾🇪/🇸🇦 NEW: Houthi (Ansarallah) forces say they carried out no military operations toward Saudi territory today and reject Saudi claims that drones were intercepted over Medina.

The group described the Saudi account as false and said such claims no longer carry credibility among the Arab and Islamic public.

@interbellumnews

⚡🇮🇷🇮🇶 Iraq closed the Al-Shaib border crossing with Iran without prior notice.

The spokesperson for the Iranian Interior Ministry expressed surprise that the closure occurred without prior official notification, noting that joint agreements obligate parties to provide advance notice if the closure continues for more than one day.

